  "ingredients": [
    "3 cup cauliflower (cut into florets)",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "3 tablespoon unsweetened almond milk",
    "12 ounce ground beef (80/20)",
    "1/4 cup almond flour",
    "2 teaspoon fresh parsley (chopped)",
    "2 teaspoon worcestershire sauce",
    "1/4 teaspoon onion powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 1/2 cup cremini mushrooms (sliced)",
    "1/4 cup beef broth",
    "2 tablespoon sour cream"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Bring a pot of water to boil and season it liberally with salt. Add the cauliflower and boil for 10 minutes or until it’s tender.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-salisbury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-53068-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/salsibury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain the cauliflower, then transfer it to a bowl to mash up with the butter and almond milk. Set it aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-salisbury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-53068-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/salsibury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat your oven to 375F. Line a baking sheet with foil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-salisbury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-53068-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/salsibury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, mix together the ground beef, almond flour, parsley, Worcestershire sauce, onion powder, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-salisbury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-53068-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/salsibury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the mixture into patties to create the Salisbury steaks, then place on the foil-lined baking sheet. Bake for 20 minutes or until the patties are cooked through.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-salisbury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-53068-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/salsibury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat a large skillet over medium-high heat with the olive oil to start the mushroom gravy. Add the mushrooms, then cook until they soften and brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-salisbury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-53068-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/salsibury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in the beef broth and stir often, scraping up any browned bits from the bottom of the pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-salisbury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-53068-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/salsibury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in the sour cream, then remove the pan from the heat. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-salisbury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-53068-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/salsibury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower-14.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the Salisbury steaks with the mashed cauliflower. Top with the mushroom gravy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-salisbury-steak-with-mashed-cauliflower/#wprm-recipe-53068-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
